        "created_at": "2021-11-01T15:56:53.424Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yep, it’s a pretty solid gimmick. If you want a tiny bit of extra oomph, replacing Chrono-Ranger with Greatest Legacy gives you an extra use of Omnitron’s power each round, while replacing him with Parse lets you use Anthony to dig for Extrasensory Awareness and then have more control over which cards you discard.</p>\n<p>(You can use a similar trick against Wager Master; get him to play Not All He Seems and then mill through his deck at high speed to end the game.)</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-11-01T15:56:53.424Z",
